{"id":"n31759-1-7","stage":2,"title":"정신없이 · 无心顾及地","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n31759-1-7-1","ko":"시장에서 지갑을 잃어버렸다면서?","zh":"听说你在市场里把钱包弄丢了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"시장에서","meaning":"市场","explanation":"시장：市场；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"시장","audio":"/audio/b46fa208d9de21d2daf1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17193","senseId":"1","lemma":"시장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지갑을","meaning":"钱包，钱夹，钱袋","explanation":"지갑：钱包，钱夹，钱袋；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"지갑","audio":"/audio/523a0f1558bc4c4dce2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31502","senseId":"1","lemma":"지갑","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잃어버렸다면서?","meaning":"丢，丢失，遗失","explanation":"잃어버리다：丢，丢失，遗失；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다면서：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"잃어버리다","audio":"/audio/9cf9d89321e22dcf7c31.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68753","senseId":"1","lemma":"잃어버리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"b46fa208d9de21d2","term":"시장","zh":"市场","audio":"/audio/b46fa208d9de21d2daf1.mp3","entryId":"17193","definition":"买卖各种商品的地方。","pronunciation":["시ː장"]},{"id":"523a0f1558bc4c4d","term":"지갑","zh":"钱包，钱夹，钱袋","audio":"/audio/523a0f1558bc4c4dce2b.mp3","entryId":"31502","definition":"为便于携带钱、卡、名片等物品，用皮或布料制作的小包。","pronunciation":["지갑"]},{"id":"9cf9d89321e22dcf","term":"잃어버리다","zh":"丢，丢失，遗失","audio":"/audio/9cf9d89321e22dcf7c31.mp3","entryId":"68753","definition":"丢掉原本拥有的东西而不再拥有。","pronunciation":["이러버리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5ccbaa5c218e022b81d8.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n31759-1-7-2","ko":"응, 얼마나 정신없이 찾으러 다녔는지 몰라.","zh":"对，我当时找得有多拼命，你根本想象不到。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"얼마나","meaning":"多么","explanation":"얼마나：多么","readings":[{"term":"얼마나","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67316","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼마나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정신없이","meaning":"无心顾及地，没有心思地","explanation":"정신없이：无心顾及地，没有心思地","readings":[{"term":"정신없이","audio":"/audio/0b33d31a0711bfb72828.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31759","senseId":"1","lemma":"정신없이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"찾으러","meaning":"寻，觅，访，寻找，查","explanation":"찾다：寻，觅，访，寻找，查；으러：用于移动动词前，表示移动的目的：“去/来做……”。","readings":[{"term":"찾다","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57320","senseId":"1","lemma":"찾다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다녔는지","meaning":"来往，走遍，","explanation":"다니다：来往，走遍，；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"다니다","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29702","senseId":"4","lemma":"다니다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"몰라.","meaning":"不知道","explanation":"모르다：不知道；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"6","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"7ab030dec3a95b0f","term":"얼마나","zh":"多么","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3","entryId":"67316","definition":"状态或感觉等的程度非常大而厉害地。","pronunciation":["얼마나"]},{"id":"0b33d31a0711bfb7","term":"정신없이","zh":"无心顾及地，没有心思地","audio":"/audio/0b33d31a0711bfb72828.mp3","entryId":"31759","definition":"受到惊吓或过于专注于某事而无心考虑周全或作出正确判断地。","pronunciation":["정시넙씨"]},{"id":"0aa19509314fd879","term":"찾다","zh":"寻，觅，访，寻找，查","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3","entryId":"57320","definition":"为了得到某物或为了见某人而四处查找；或指得到此物或见此人。","pronunciation":["찯따"]},{"id":"02309ed22c9c3627","term":"다니다","zh":"来往，走遍，","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3","entryId":"29702","definition":"到处走动。","pronunciation":["다니다"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"很了不起，简直无以言表。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b52f200c4bb1bcf13197.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.898,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=31759","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":66,"sequenceScore":1.6233,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["听说你在市场里把钱包弄丢了？","对，我当时找得有多拼命，你根本想象不到。","这位就是我哥哥。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["听说你在市场里把钱包弄丢了？","对，我当时找得有多拼命，你根本想象不到。","这位就是我哥哥。"],"answer":1}]}
